<title>QATAR: SOCCER-QATAR BEAT PHILIPPINES 5-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-QATAR BEAT PHILIPPINES 5-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar beat the Philippines 5-0 (halftime 5-0) in a World Cup Asian group 10 qualifier on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Mohammad Salem al-Enazi (18, 41), Mohammad Soufi (27), Adel Khamis (30), Abdul Aziz Hassan (37).</p>
